# Ratchet bank (§13.2 Track 1). The bank's integrity model hashes each case
# file's BYTES and witnesses that sha256 in ledger.jsonl. Prettier is not a
# fixed point on `json.dumps(indent=2)` output (it collapses short arrays onto
# one line), so a single reformat would break every sha and make `rsi-ratchet.py
# check` report a phantom TAMPER — a forged tamper alarm, not a formatting nit.
# Only rsi-ratchet.py may write here.
plugins/rsi-loop/ratchet/

